Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.99,Italics,CM,0,0,0,,To a world of dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:13.26,Italics,CM,0,0,0,,with the one you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:18.61,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Today's our first date in a \Nlong time, and it's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:18.61,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1300,1)\fnArial\an1\fs14\shad0\pos(400,99.334)\b1\3c&H25385F&}To a world of dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.61,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1300,1)\fnArial\an1\fs14\shad0\b1\3c&H25385F&\pos(443.333,182)}with the one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:24.14,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Because today, I get to be with \NShikimori-san until late tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:29.50,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I came up with a plan to make \Nsure she'll have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:32.19,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure this goes perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:33.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:38.51,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Did I keep you waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:41.38,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-Your outfit...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.38,0:00:45.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought a skirt might \Nbe too restrictive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:47.91,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I wanted something comfortable\N to walk around in,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:50.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,so I borrowed my mom's coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:51.39,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:53.67,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She looks so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:55.44,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
