Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\an1\fnTimes New Roman\bord1.5\b1\fs28\shad0\3c&H1B191E&\pos(54,310)}#12  {\fs24\fscy110}Better Than a Dream
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:38.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Wh-Where should we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:41.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Heh, heh, heh.\N First order of business is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:45.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,This, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:47.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,E-Ears? They're cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:51.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,B-But that kind of thing \Nisn't really for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:54.23,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\bord1\blur4\3c&H404142&\pos(320.242,267.818)}Embarrassed to Death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:57.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you in some, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:03:01.42,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'd love to see you wear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:04.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Um... well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:08.54,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,A s-skull?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:15.04,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But look. If I fasten up my coat...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:18.78,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Doesn't it sort of match what I'm wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:20.37,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's a prince from the underworld!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:22.30,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,A million points!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.39,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.90,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's ride this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:26.76,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:28.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,There's a 90-minute wait?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:31.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, it just opened last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:34.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,If you don't get here early,\N apparently it can take up to 180 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:37.40,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:39.60,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:40.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Briars, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:44.87,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Briar Rose... She's from\N {\i1}Sleeping Beauty{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:47.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What was that story about again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:52.15,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The princess is cursed \Nto slumber for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:56.64,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And in that time, the castle\N becomes overgrown with briars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:00.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The prince braves the thicket, \Nheedless of the danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,to find the princess. He then kisses her,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:06.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,freeing her from her century-long curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:11.00,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I had no idea. So that's how it goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:14.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, you don't seem\N like you'd be into fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:18.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,How rude! I liked picture books \Njust like everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:21.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But you didn't know {\i1}Sleeping Beauty?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:22.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Which was your favorite, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:25.36,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:28.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Ugly Duckling{\i0}, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:32.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That's so dark! Did something \Nsad happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:34.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No, of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:38.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I just enjoy things that have a little edge,\N like horror and suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:40.10,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Still dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:41.41,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,And that's still rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:46.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Remember the first time we went \Nto see a movie together
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:49.18,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,and you said you were okay\N with whatever I wanted to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:51.56,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:56.56,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Then at the fireworks, you said \Nyou wanted me to see your cute side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:05:01.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But I want to see all of you,\N not just your cute side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:08.40,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Of course, I already know your \Nproud side that hates to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:14.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hey, Shikimori-san, do you have a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:17.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I do, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:18.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Really? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:22.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I once read a shojo manga...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:25.22,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,A romance story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:28.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It made me think love was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,My dream is to experience it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:34.35,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But that dream's already come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.57,Main,Woman2 E12,0,0,0,,Still waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:46.82,Main,Guy E12,0,0,0,,This is taking ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:05:57.47,Main,Guide,0,0,0,,Step forward, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:02.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That 90-minute wait kinda \Nflew right by, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:03.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:06.39,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Be careful. Watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:07.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.41,0:06:11.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:11.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:16.30,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Welcome to the world of {\i0}Sleeping Beauty{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.31,0:06:30.72,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's a slower ride than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.12,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,There are some aromatic fragrances,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:36.92,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,pretty music, and a gentle rocking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:41.88,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I'm getting sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Isn't it lovely, Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:46.89,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.55,0:06:56.36,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,After being kissed by the prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:03.15,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Sleeping Beauty awoke from \Nher hundred-year slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:07.91,Main,Guide,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:10.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The ride's over, Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:15.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I fell asleep toward the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:17.40,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But it was really pretty, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-It really was. \NI can still smell that nice aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:23.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What did you think? Did you enjoy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:25.04,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:29.42,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Although I wasn't expecting such a long wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:33.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah. Shall we go for one \Nwith a shorter line next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:43.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'd wait in any line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:49.03,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sh-Shikimori?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.86,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Because as long as I'm with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:54.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,any time we spend together\N is just so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:07:59.83,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get to the next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:02.17,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry before it gets dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.03,0:08:11.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,There's no need to rush. \NWe have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:36.33,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:39.84,Main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,I-I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:43.67,Main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,We gave your table to \Nanother guest by mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:47.83,Main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,and all the tables for the course \Nyou reserved are already taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:50.96,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,O-Of all the luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:54.68,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This was the centerpiece\N of my entire date plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.82,Main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,I could arrange a different table.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:09:00.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh... Really? That'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:06.47,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:08.34,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:14.08,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This is an incredible upgrade!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:16.99,Main,Waitress,0,0,0,,What would you like to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:19.99,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,O-Orange juice, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.19,0:09:22.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll have a ginger ale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:24.51,Main,Waitress,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:28.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Th-The lady up front was really nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:31.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes, to give us such an expensive table...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:40.26,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's way too formal!\N My jacket sticks out like a sore thumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:41.97,Main,Waiter,0,0,0,,Here you are, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:42.51,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You switched gears fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:50.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow, this looks so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:54.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait, is this napkin supposed \Nto go over my lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:56.66,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think so, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.55,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Why are there so many forks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:02.66,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've heard you start with \Nthe one on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.65,0:10:07.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.61,0:10:11.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:15.21,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Your eyes are always\N glimmering like a child's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.30,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Aw, I made you self-conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Did I get carried away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:24.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Don't worry yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:30.30,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,When I'm with you, Izumi-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:35.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,all kinds of things seem \Nprettier than usual to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.66,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So I have to wonder sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:45.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,How beautiful must the world \Nlook through your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:50.96,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-You're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.37,0:10:53.02,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:55.89,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can't even tell how\N the food tastes anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hey, Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:04.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What do you see in my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:07.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:14.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,M-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:20.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're all I'm ever looking at, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:24.20,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's just not letting up with the overkill!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:26.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, for me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:32.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The most b-beautiful thing I see... is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:37.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:43.18,Main,Waitress,0,0,0,,I'll take any dishes you're finished with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.35,Main,Izu/Shiki,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:47.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:51.05,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Full-course meals really are a lot of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:55.86,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We still have some time. \NIs there anywhere you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:05.61,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:08.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:13.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,t-to do what they did in the commercial!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:20.61,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:24.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.00,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1440,1)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\b1\3c&H25385F&\pos(496.667,100.001)}To a world of dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:28.00,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1130,1)\an8\fnArial\fs14\shad0\b1\3c&H25385F&\pos(496.667,166.001)}with the one you love
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:31.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:34.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Y-You agreed so readily...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:36.84,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's not waste any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:37.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Right here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:39.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:44.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hohay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:51.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So... how do I escort you, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:51.91,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:55.79,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, when you said\N "what they did in the commercial,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:13:00.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,you meant after the little girl's \Nparents take her hands, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:01.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:05.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So the part where the old man \Nescorts the old lady, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:09.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait, that's not what you meant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:12.10,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry! Um, then which part {\i1}did{\i0} you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:17.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This is fun in its own way, so it's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:22.00,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere we can just talk awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:26.03,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,O-Okay. Let's find a place with \Na nice view of the sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:30.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Be sure to escort me properly, my prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.53,0:13:32.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:33.99,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.93,0:13:44.05,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What was it she really wanted to do, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.88,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,At the end of that commercial, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.55,0:13:52.26,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sh-She couldn't have meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.93,Main,Worker,0,0,0,,Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:02.44,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This view is really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:04.69,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:07.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:09.70,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:13.70,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Since I figured out what she meant about \Nthe commercial, I'm all nervous...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:20.71,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! We haven't taken a picture \Nyet today. Let's get one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:21.59,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:23.84,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:26.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is the background in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:29.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay, say cheese—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:30.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:32.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait, why...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:37.90,Italics,PA,0,0,0,,{\an8}Attention, guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:41.54,Italics,PA,0,0,0,,{\an8}The park is currently \Nexperiencing a power outage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.55,Italics,PA,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please bear with us until power is restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:46.86,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,There goes my bad luck! \NAnd our gorgeous nighttime scenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:50.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The boat stopped, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:52.26,Main,Sizumi,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:53.46,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:55.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:58.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.88,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The other boats have lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:05.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We can use our smartphones, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:06.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:08.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.69,0:15:11.61,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It really is pitch black.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:13.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I can't see anything but the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:20.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I never dreamed this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:24.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I hope they get the power back on soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:26.43,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:31.42,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:37.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Now it really is just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:40.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,See?! This is what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:43.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're just like a prince! \NHow can you do that so naturally?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:45.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Does it make you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:46.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Incredibly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.75,0:15:49.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm glad, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's kind of weird, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:59.69,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can't see anything but you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:04.98,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's like being in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:12.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,For just this moment, there's nothing \Nelse to steal your attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,so you're looking only at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:23.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,If I could have dreams like this, \NI wouldn't want to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:28.41,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What if you end up drifting \Nfar away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:33.34,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What can I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:38.47,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,to make you feel at ease?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:47.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Careful—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:48.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:53.98,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.83,0:16:57.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:00.43,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll stay with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So please don't worry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:16.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm really...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,no match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:24.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, the lights are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:27.10,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let me stay like this a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:35.41,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I guess she doesn't want to wake up\N from the dream just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:39.06,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sh-Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:44.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Also, I didn't mean for what \NI said to turn that serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:47.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? Y-You didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:50.00,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:54.76,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm happier than I'd be in any dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:57.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:13.31,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey, Izumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:16.65,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Why do you look like some \Nmodern art installment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:23.64,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I didn't think about it until I was \Nin the bath after I got home last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:24.58,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:24.91,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:28.67,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,How could I have done \Nsomething so assertive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:33.29,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You can twist yourself up even more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:36.19,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Come on, tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:38.89,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We know something happened, Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:41.80,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You're better off just spilling now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.80,0:18:45.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,R-R-Really, nothing happened at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:48.06,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're a lousy liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:51.06,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She's not talking, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:53.92,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Clearly, there's been some \Nsort of development.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:57.69,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Hmm... Silence in this case \Ncan only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.57,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You kissed, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.57,0:19:00.54,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.69,0:19:07.41,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You k-k-k-kissed him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.22,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:09.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Not so loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.16,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Er... Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:18.15,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,W-Would you mind explaining \Nin a bit more detail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.15,0:19:19.84,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Relax, Assistant Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:23.54,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We had dinner at a really \Nupscale restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:27.19,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,so the mood was right. \NThen we took a gondola ride...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:28.02,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:30.20,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But the power went out. \NEverything went dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:32.35,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,His bad luck never fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:36.37,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,And that's when Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:39.99,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,k-kissed my cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:41.57,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.57,0:19:43.88,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,That stupid Izumi wimped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:45.37,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,N-No, he didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:49.82,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,He, well... seemed to think \NI was feeling uneasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:51.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,so he did it to comfort me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:53.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,He was very sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:55.50,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:57.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:57.88,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:20:02.99,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to get as close \Nas possible to Izumi-san lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:05.51,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,so I was being pretty proactive, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:08.67,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Wait, wait! Don't suddenly go all carnivore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:12.39,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,The warm and fuzzies just\Ninstantly burned to ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:16.12,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I was panicking because \NI made him worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:20.18,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I was ashamed of myself for getting \Ndistracted by a bunch of superficial stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:22.18,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon, hang on a—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:23.40,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:28.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm going to become\N as open-hearted as Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:34.63,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,R-Really? Well, your love is \Nplenty big enough already...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:36.17,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,So are your fluctuations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:39.85,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,What do you think, Hachimitsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:44.55,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I can't tell if they're kindergarteners\N or an elderly couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.55,0:20:47.46,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Just hang on. I'll get out of that knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:49.68,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,But hey, as long as they're happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:51.67,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:54.79,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,440)\fnArial\b1\fs30\frz7\shad0\3c&HDBE6E5&\c&H5126E8&\pos(498,297.999)}S{\fs28\c&H3DCEFE&}E{\fs26\c&H5126E8&}E {\fs26\c&H3DCEFE&}Y{\fs24\c&H5126E8&}O{\fs22\c&H3DCEFE&}U{\c&H5126E8&}~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:34.33,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.34,0:22:40.17,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Good morning, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.61,0:22:43.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Good morning, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.67,0:22:46.76,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,My girlfriend is super cute, and also...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.82,0:22:59.81,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,incredibly cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.35,0:23:04.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:07.55,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.55,0:23:09.69,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You got it in one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.69,0:23:11.98,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Just incredible! You're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:14.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think that's enough, Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:17.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
